<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alza Corp downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alza Corp downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon, Read &amp; Co Inc said on Thursday it cut Alza Corp to a neutral from an outperform rating due to an earlier-than-expected Procardia XL new drug filing by a competitor and slow growth of Ethyol sales.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Jerry Treppel said in a research note he was lowering his 1998 earnings estimate to $1.38 per share from $1.44 per share, because these developments could cause Alza's earnings growth to slow over the next few years.</p>
</text>
